{"decision":"edit","issues":[{"quote":"Throughout the excerpt the internal glow drifts, starting as a uniform green that fills the base and both side reflections.","problem":"Uses the annotation phrase 'the excerpt' and overstates the initial green as uniform; the side reflections retain pale upper areas and bright flame spots."},{"quote":"As the frames advance the green cools toward cyan and then blue, the left side and its reflection shifting first while the right lingers in green.","problem":"Uses the annotation phrase 'the frames advance' and conflates the left duplicate with a separate side plus its reflection; the visible left duplicate is itself a reflection."},{"quote":"By the final frames the central vessel and left wall read blue, the right still holding a teal cast.","problem":"Uses the annotation phrase 'the final frames' and misidentifies the blue left duplicate as a wall rather than a reflection."},{"quote":"its height and width varying from frame to frame yet staying centered and lit","problem":"Uses the annotation phrase 'from frame to frame' rather than describing the flame motion directly."},{"quote":"Slight handheld jitter nudges the framing, with no deliberate pan or zoom.","problem":"Makes an absolute claim about camera motion; the visible framing shifts should be described without denying all pan or zoom."}],"caption":"The video captures a single frosted-glass votive candle holder seated at the center of a polished metallic enclosure. A small upright flame burns above the wick, keeping the upper rim pale while the lower half glows from within. Mirrored side walls cast two duplicate images of the vessel, each with a bright flame reflection, and a perforated metal panel stands behind the holder.

The internal glow drifts over time, starting as a saturated green that fills the base and lower side reflections. As it gradually cools toward cyan and then blue, the left reflection shifts first while the right lingers in green. By the later moments the central vessel and its left reflection read blue, the right still holding a teal cast.

The flame flickers subtly, varying in height and width yet staying centered and lit. Slight handheld jitter shifts the framing, without obvious pan or zoom. The mirrored reflections track the same hue change as the central object, echoing the shifting glow rather than separate lights.","length_note":""}
